  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ce339c89c788e74ebfb2e6ed570821c, type: 3}
  m_Name: FinalHint
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueStrings:
  - The final door way to the Red Room where the endgame is requires the player to
    stay below 400m for approximately 60 seconds
  - Because you need to stay for 60 Seconds you would need to grab enough oxygen
    to withstand that time.
  - After 60 seconds the doorway would spawn with a loud boom and all you have to
    do is look for it
  - The endgame is within there.
  - To get past the fish that spawns past 300m you must quickly flash it with your
    camera before it gets too close
  - If not quick enough you will die and would have to go back again.
